Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A third mode in the workout sheet: say how you are and what you fancy (typed
or dictated), pick how long (30-90 min) and how hard, and Claude proposes a
session in the same exercises-and-sets form as a told workout, ready to edit
and start with every set to tick. It is grounded in the data the AI Coach
reads (recovery, sleep, recent effort, workouts, the TRAINING LOG with past
loads, goals, body), under the coach's own consent, and told to avoid muscle
groups worked or sore in the last 48 h. Each exercise carries its rest and a
cue, shown in the editor and on the live plan; 'Another proposal' asks again.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
