+        append("- Length: about $minutes minutes in total, warm-up included. Intensity asked: ${intensity.id}.\n")
+        append("- Follow the user's words below first (muscles that are sore or were trained recently, what they want, ")
+        append("equipment, injuries). Then use the data: recovery (charge), sleep, recent effort, recent workouts and the ")
+        append("TRAINING LOG (what was trained, with which loads), goals and body. Avoid muscle groups trained hard in the last ")
